2. In these Regulations —
“ash scattering facility” means any of the following:
(a)the Garden of Peace in the Choa Chu Kang Cemetery;
(b)the Garden of Serenity in the Mandai North Crematorium;
[S 503/2025 wef 15/08/2025]
“ashes” means the remains, in powder form, of a corpse (including a stillborn child) or a human body part, that have been cremated in a crematorium.
